sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Device Agent
  participant B as Broker TLS/ACL
  participant R as AEAD Receiver
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant O as Outbox Relay
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant W as Dashboard
  D->>B: Encrypted telemetry v2 + authenticated AAD
  B->>R: MQTT QoS1 ciphertext
  R->>R: Verify profile/key/nonce/tag/AAD
  R->>P: Transaction: replay admission + security observation + Outbox + eligible receipt
  P-->>R: Commit
  R-->>B: Application delivery acknowledgement
  O->>P: Claim committed Outbox event
  O->>M: Idempotent insert by device:epoch:sequence
  M-->>O: Durable write acknowledgement
  O->>P: Mark delivered
  W->>P: Read committed identity/status
  W->>M: Read history
